  "descriptions": {
    "en_US": "HyperOS1\n⚠️ The system and themes can bug out sometimes, so back up your stuff first unless you wanna deal with a mess later‼️\n⚠️ If things get glitchy after you apply the theme, just restart your phone and it should load up clean‼️",
    "zh_CN": "HyperOS1 Theme. Apply and reboot your phone.",
    "fallback": "HyperOS1 Theme. Apply and reboot your phone."
  },
